      "sourceTextSha256": "8f7b1789e55ff98e8b0892085799147eea1c5eb06aec341ddecab1ed49f1cd2d",
      "text": "After breakfast, walk through Chapada dos Guimarães National Park to Bridal Veil Waterfall; the full nature programme is set out in the excursion below.\n\nAfter the excursion, have lunch at a local restaurant. Return to Park Eco Lodge and enjoy free time to relax or explore the property's own trails.\n\nTowards evening, walk up to the observation tower. At sunset, the view opens towards São Jerônimo Peak and across the Cerrado, as the changing light alters the colours of the plains and rocks. Spend a second night at Park Eco Lodge.\n\nMeals: breakfast, lunch and dinner.",
      "provenance": {
