        "model": "GPT-6",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261104-f15fc6575170",
        "wordAbsenceReason": "Verified Word p33 combines the national-park excursion with the day's logistics. It has no separate current RU text referring readers to the canonical excursion below; translating the unique RU day node avoids duplicating that excursion while preserving its lunch, lodge, sunset and meals.",
